      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA surface layer is multi-element and has high configurational entropy.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7304825::chunk::001::introduction::c558c6fff9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA layer forms a protective, self-healing film.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HEA coating creates a chemically and structurally robust barrier.",
